 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0800

lingmo-core (5.0.6+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * lingmo-services: add polkit policy for apt-get (org.lingmo.update.apt),
    allowing the update service to run apt-get update and apt-get upgrade
    without a password prompt in active sessions.
  * lingmo-services: use absolute path /usr/bin/apt-get in pkexec calls so
    polkit can match the exec.path annotation reliably.
  * session: rename session description to "Lingmo desktop".
  * po/zh_CN: update session translation to match.
  * debian/control: fix homepage URL capitalisation.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 05:30:00 +0800

lingmo-core (5.0.5+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * lingmo-services: UpdateManager: add lastCheckTime, changelogText and
    errorLog properties; fetch Markdown changelog from releases.json when
    the API reports a new version; collect apt-get stderr into errorLog on
    upgrade failure; add installing phase (5) to state and expose it via
    D-Bus upgradePhase property.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0800

lingmo-core (5.0.4+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * lingmo-services: add UpdateManager, a new system update service on
    org.lingmo.Services.Update. It checks the lingmo.org API and apt in
    two stages, distinguishes system upgrades from regular software
    updates, and reports download and install progress via D-Bus signals.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0800



